        "text": "### FORK — a fork roster\n\n`FORK` is an **existence-only** check, exactly like the wiki-client *Twins* strip: a slug match in a family member's sitemap, with no journal or lineage inspection. A group with no match is hidden entirely, so the panel only grows an element when a family member has actually forked the page — a quiet way to watch who in your family is twinning your work. Each fork row's flag links straight to that member's copy.\n\n```\nSISTERS\nFORK\n```"
